  "body": "### Added\r\n- Method `RemoteReaderServer.getInitialCardContent(Class<T>)`, which provides the initial card content as an instance of the expected type: the smart card type (e.g. `CalypsoCard`), or `java.util.Properties` for the clients using the Server JSON API.\r\n### Changed\r\n- The initial card content provided by `RemoteReaderServer` must now be a `SmartCard` or a `java.util.Properties` object (Server JSON API). Other types are no longer provided.\r\n### Deprecated\r\n- Method `RemoteReaderServer.getInitialCardContent()`, replaced by `getInitialCardContent(Class<T>)`.\r\n### Upgraded\r\n- `keyple-distributed-network-java-lib` from `2.5.2` to `2.6.0`\r\n- `keyple-util-java-lib` from `2.4.1` to `2.5.0`"
